        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lexington%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lexington narrowly lost a vote by only thirty-three ballots to determine the county seat of Morrow County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lexington%2C_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The arrival of the railroad in 1888 helped Lexington grow from a small settlement into a burgeoning town.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
